    LLM: "Focus on forming canastas quickly. Avoid getting stuck with Red Threes or Black Threes at the end.\n\nCoordinate with your partner. If your partner is close to going out, help them by forming the required canastas.\n\nTrack which cards have been discarded to anticipate what's left in the stock. Time your 'going out' to maximize your score while minimizing opponents' scores.",
